.TH "INSPEKT\-SUMMARIZE" "1" "2026\-04\-16" "Inspekt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inspekt\-summarize \- Summarize the current article using AI.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]summarize\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Summarize the current article using AI.
.PP
Extracts article content using Mozilla Readability and generates a
concise summary using the configured AI model (mods).
.PP
Perfect for:
.IP \(bu 2
Quickly understanding long articles
.IP \(bu 2
Getting the key points of a news story
.IP \(bu 2
Summarizing blog posts or documentation
.PP
The \(enformat option controls output:
.IP \(bu 2
summary: AI\-generated summary (default)
.IP \(bu 2
full: Show the full extracted article text
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\(enget\-url\f[R]
Output the inspekt:// URL instead of executing
.TP
\f[B]\(enformat\f[R], \f[I][summary|full]\f[R]
Output format (summary or full article) (default: \f[CR]summary\f[R])
.TP
\f[B]\(enlang\f[R], \f[I]TEXT\f[R]
Language for AI output (overrides config)
.TP
\f[B]\(endebug\f[R]
Show the full prompt instead of calling AI
.TP
\f[B]\(enforce\-refresh\f[R]
Force refresh, bypass cache
.TP
\f[B]\(enjson\f[R]
Output as JSON with metadata
.TP
\f[B]\-o\f[R], \f[B]\(enoutput\f[R], \f[I]PATH\f[R]
Save output to file (.txt for text, .mp3 for audio)
.TP
\f[B]\(enspeak\f[R], \f[I]VOICE\f[R]
Read the summary aloud using TTS (\(enspeak for default voice, \(enspeak
margot for specific)
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
.EX
inspekt summarize
inspekt summarize \-\-format full
inspekt summarize \-\-language en
inspekt summarize \-\-json
inspekt summarize \-\-speak margot
.EE
